desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Detect JDBC URL With Inline Credentials"
	title_zh: "检测带内联凭据的 JDBC URL",
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-secret-jdbc-inline"
	risk: "hardcoded-credentials"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测 Detect JDBC URL With Inline Credentials 相关的风险模式。

### 风险类型
硬编码凭据（hardcoded-credentials）

### 影响
代码中直接写入账号、令牌等敏感凭据，泄露后攻击者可直接使用这些凭据访问系统或服务。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
False-positive hardening: ignore documentation placeholders like {username}:{password}.
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
移除硬编码凭据，改用环境变量、密钥管理服务或安全配置中心，并立即轮换已泄露的凭据。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://application.properties": <<<POS
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-secret-jdbc-inline
POS
	"safefile://application-safe.properties": <<<NEG
spring.datasource.url=jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/app
spring.datasource.username=${DB_USER}
spring.datasource.password=${DB_PASS}
docs=jdbc:pgsql://{username}:{password}@host/db
NEG
)

${*}.pattern_regex_not(/(?:(?i)jdbc:[a-z0-9]+:\/\/[^"'\s]*:[^\/"'\s]+@)|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-secret\-jdbc\-inline/, /(?i)jdbc:[a-z0-9]+:\/\/\{[a-z0-9_]+\}:\{[a-z0-9_]+\}@/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "JDBC Inline Credentials",
	title_zh: "JDBC 内联凭据",
	message: "JDBC URL contains inline username/password",
}
